  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banana Cluster Sustainability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is for the organisation Global Reporting Initiative (GRI) to train the trainers of Solidaridad and members of Solidaridad&#x2019;s organic banana cluster in Peru on the GRI sustainable reporting standards.Firstly, this will allow members of the organic banana cluster to gain skills in sustainable reporting. They will use their new skills to increase access to existing and new possibilities for access to finance.Secondly, Solidaridad will be able to repeat the training for other companies in sustainability reporting and increase opportunities for access to finance.</narrative>
  </description>
